WEBVTT

00:04:58.104 --> 00:05:00.240
"Can I have a ride?"

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.115
(Laughter)

00:05:02.115 --> 00:05:04.632
And of course there's the occasional person --

00:05:04.632 --> 00:05:06.448
usually a middle-aged male who will say,

00:05:06.448 --> 00:05:08.089
"Oh, those wheels are great!

00:05:08.089 --> 00:05:10.379
I guess they're for safety, right?"

00:05:10.379 --> 00:05:12.728
(Laughter)

00:05:12.728 --> 00:05:18.696
No! They're not for safety.

00:05:18.696 --> 00:05:20.576
No, no, no, no, no.

00:05:20.576 --> 00:05:22.353
What's the difference here,

00:05:22.353 --> 00:05:24.160
the wheelchair with no lights

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.890
and the wheelchair with lights?

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:29.672
The difference is intent.

00:05:29.672 --> 00:05:33.329
That's right, that's right; I'm no longer a victim.